## Verification Commands

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `bash ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/starters/scripts/run-tests.sh <ts\|p>` | Unit tests |
| `bash ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/starters/scripts/run-typecheck.sh <ts\|p>` | Type check |
| `bash ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/starters/scripts/run-lint.sh <ts\|p>` | Lint |
| `bash ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/starters/scripts/run-build.sh <ts\|p>` | Build |
| `bash ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/starters/scripts/run-markdown-lint.sh <ts\|p>` | Markdown lint |
| `bash ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/starters/scripts/run-format-check.sh <ts\|p>` | Format check |
| `bash ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/starters/scripts/run-e2e.sh <ts\|p>` | E2E tests |

