## Knowledge Base (kb/)

The `kb/` directory documents project-specific conventions that EDF skills read at runtime:

| File | Purpose | Read by |
|------|---------|---------|
| `kb/architecture.md` | Architecture rules, API composition patterns, reusable helper catalogue | `/lld`, `/pr-review`, `/lld-sync` |
| `kb/anti-patterns.md` | Framework/language anti-patterns, Helper reuse section | `/pr-review`, `/lld-sync` |
| `kb/conventions.md` | File naming/path conventions, test suffix, schema patterns | `/pr-review` |
| `kb/file-map.md` | Logical concept → file path mappings (engine-dir, api-dir, etc.) | `/pr-review`, `/lld-sync` |

Populate these from `starters/kb/` on first use.

